  "title": "Marelli awards multi-year global automotive software engineering contract to Wipro",
  "summary": "Bangalore, India and Saitama, Japan – September 08, 2020: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading global information technology, consulting, and business process services company and Marelli, today announced that they have entered into a multi-year global agreement for automotive engineering services.",
